    {
      "source": "<a href=\"ServletWebServerApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.server.servlet.context\"><code>ServletWebServerApplicationContext</code></a> that accepts annotated classes as input - in\nparticular <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/Configuration.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>@Configuration</code></a>\n-annotated classes, but also plain <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/stereotype/Component.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.stereotype\"><code>@Component</code></a> classes and JSR-330\ncompliant classes using <code>javax.inject</code> annotations.",
      "translation": "接受注解类作为输入的<a href=\"ServletWebServerApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.server.servlet.context\"><code>ServletWebServerApplicationContext</code></a>——特别是<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/Configuration.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>@Configuration</code></a>注解类，但也包括普通的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/stereotype/Component.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.stereotype\"><code>@Component</code></a>类和使用<code>javax.inject</code>注解的符合 JSR-330 规范的类。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "A <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/context/WebApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.context\"><code>WebApplicationContext</code></a> that can be used to bootstrap itself from a contained\n<a href=\"../ServletWebServerFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.web.server.servlet\"><code>ServletWebServerFactory</code></a> bean.",
      "translation": "一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/context/WebApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.context\"><code>WebApplicationContext</code></a>，可用于从包含的 <a href=\"../ServletWebServerFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.web.server.servlet\"><code>ServletWebServerFactory</code></a>  Bean 引导自身。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"ServletWebServerApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.server.servlet.context\"><code>ServletWebServerApplicationContext</code></a> which takes its configuration from XML\ndocuments, understood by an\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/xml/XmlBeanDefinitionReader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.xml\"><code>XmlBeanDefinitionReader</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"ServletWebServerApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.server.servlet.context\"><code>ServletWebServerApplicationContext</code></a> 从 XML 文档获取其配置，这些文档由 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/xml/XmlBeanDefinitionReader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.xml\"><code>XmlBeanDefinitionReader</code></a> 理解。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Enables scanning for Servlet components (<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/annotation/WebFilter.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet.annotation\"><code>filters</code></a>, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/annotation/WebServlet.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet.annotation\"><code>servlets</code></a>, and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/annotation/WebListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet.annotation\"><code>listeners</code></a>).",
      "translation": "启用 Servlet 组件的扫描（<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/annotation/WebFilter.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet.annotation\"><code>filters</code></a>、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/annotation/WebServlet.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet.annotation\"><code>servlets</code></a> 和 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/annotation/WebListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet.annotation\"><code>listeners</code></a>）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Variant of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/context/support/ServletContextAwareProcessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.context.support\"><code>ServletContextAwareProcessor</code></a> for use with a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/context/ConfigurableWebApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.context\"><code>ConfigurableWebApplicationContext</code></a>.",
